Title:
    **ADMIRAL BYRD**
    **AND THE HIDDEN REALM**
Credit: Written by
Author: Zac Lester
Source: Inspired by the legend of Admiral Richard E. Byrd's "lost diary"
Draft date: First Draft - November 2026
Contact:
